  "description": "<p><strong>⭐</strong> Gift a night of music, story, and light with <strong>LUMINISCENCE — London</strong>, a breathtaking 360° projection experience transforming Westminster Cathedral into a world of sound and wonder<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🏆 The London premiere of this spectacular experience that has already dazzled over one million spectators across the world and thousands at its critically acclaimed UK debut in Manchester<br>\n💎 A breathtaking 360-degree cutting-edge video-mapping experience that brings to life the story of London and one of its most important cathedrals<br>\n🗣️ A specially commissioned script by BAFTA and Olivier Award-winning writer Tim Whitnall voiced by star of Paddington and Downton Abbey, Hugh Bonneville<br>\n✨ Show Exclusive! Westminster Cathedral’s, never completed, mosaic adorned domes are digitally brought to life for the very first time in the architect's original vision<br>\n🎶 Live musical performances of some of classical music's greatest composers, performed by the Lux Aeterna choir<br>\n🕍 Check out the LUMINISCENCE Live+ 14-piece orchestra and Lux Aeterna choir select sessions<br>\n⛪ A one-of-a-kind chance to (re)discover one of London’s most iconic landmarks<br>\n👨‍👩‍👧 A magical experience to enjoy with your partner, friends, or family<br>\n⭐ Fast-track entry and best views seating for Gold ticket holders<br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: approximately 50 minutes<br>\n📍 Location: Westminster Cathedral<br>\n👤 Age requirement: no minimum age<br>\n🪑 A seated show with tiered pricing according to best views<br>\n🎟️ Group and Family ticket rates available<br>\n♿ Accessibility: venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\n❓ Check the FAQs for this experience <a href=\"https://luminiscence.com/london/#faqs\" target=\"_blank\"><u>here</u></a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Gift Card Info</strong><br>\n📨 How it works